--
contract_assert(e) is an assertion statement ([stmt.contract.assert]).  CBMC
reported "symbol 'contract_assert' is unknown" (CONVERSION ERROR); it now
checks it, and pre() and post(), with the enforce semantic
(cpp26_contract_assertions_enforced).  Checked with GCC 16 -fcontracts.
